\title{metasurvey.explorer.backend: R Client for the 'metasurvey' Recipe and Workflow API}
\description{
HTTP client for the 'metasurvey' REST API, part of the 'metasurvey' ecosystem. Lets R users publish, discover, and share recipes and workflows against a deployed 'metasurvey' API server, and manage authentication, stars, and comments. On load it registers providers so that the local 'metasurvey.core' backend and 'metasurvey.anda' variable lookups can route to the remote API.
